That index is down 2.66% year-to-date and up 1.09% since the practice portfolio opened

00:00:48.132 --> 00:00:50.072
on March 16, 2026.

00:00:50.072 --> 00:01:02.152
The S&amp;P 500 finished at 6,910, down 3.7%, and the TSX composite at 33,190, down 2.5%,

